flowchart TD
  R[Georeferenced Relative] --> X{Reference exact grid or separate GCPs?}
  X -->|No| K[Reject; metric files locked]
  X -->|Yes| F[Robust positive affine fit]
  F --> G{Positive scale; span; inliers; 2-axis coverage; held-out RMSE; R2}
  G -->|Any fail| K
  G -->|All pass| M[Metric Calibrated]
  M --> O[metric_surface.npy + tif + metric grid]
  G --> P[calibration_report + residual evidence]
  K --> P

